# ==============================================================================
# FLIPSCAN ROOT ENVIRONMENT TEMPLATE
# ==============================================================================
# Copy this file to .env or configure in your deployment platform (EAS, Supabase, etc.)
# Secrets (Anthropic, eBay, Supabase Service Role) MUST live in edge-function secrets.
# Public keys (EXPO_PUBLIC_*) are bundled into the mobile app binary.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase Configuration
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
